# Reload from the quiver (reports/archery/2026-11-05-quiver-reload), step 0: the three talent steps held drawn in
# the field with the sun on the side; the rq_* columns give the quiver's mouth and axis, the head, the shoulder,
# the bow's grip, the string and the arrow in the chest's frame (BowDraw::Probe). The clips of the pilot come
# here once the line of the draw is decided
cheat god
set time 16 0
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 90
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 30
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1200 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
tap bow
wait 1500
stats str 30 dex 10 bow 10 talent 0
volley 1 300
wait 500
cam follow 170 140 -40
rec t0_hold_frontright
volley 1 2500
stop
cam follow 170 140 -100
rec t0_hold_back
volley 1 2500
stop
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 40 talent 1
volley 1 300
wait 500
cam follow 170 140 -40
rec t1_hold_frontright
volley 1 2500
stop
stats str 120 dex 150 bow 100 talent 2
volley 1 300
wait 500
cam follow 170 140 -40
rec t2_hold_frontright
volley 1 2500
stop
cam follow 170 140 -100
rec t2_hold_back
volley 1 2500
stop
